MEMBER TERMS: ‘The Commission shall consist of five (5) members. Five (5) members shall be appointed by the Mayor and Council of the City of McIntyre. The five (5) members appointed by the Mayor and Council shall be citizens of the City of McIntyre and the respective terms of the members shall begin as follows:

- (1) One member for one year; (2) Two members for three years;

- (3) ‘Two members for four years;

and thereafter upon the expiration of such terms, successors shall be appointed for a term of four years by the Mayor and Council. Vacancies caused by death, resignation or otherwise shall be filled for the unexpired term by Mayor and Council,

3:
The Commission herein created shall have the power and authority:

- (1) To study and determine the problems and needs of the City of McIntyre for planting of trees and shrubberies in public places;

- (2) To recommend to the proper authorities and officials of the City of McIntyre the types and kinds of trees and shrubs to be planted upon the right of way of mmicipal streets, public parks and public facilities;

- (3) To assist the City, Park, and Recreation Department in a program to protect and maintain existing trees, shrubs and green areas on all City owned property and public properties; °

- (4) To recommend to Mayor and Council removal of any trees or shrubbery deemed to be hazardous to the public safety or public health;

(5} To assist the proper officials and make available to the general public ' mews and information regarding the selection, planting and maintenance of trees, shrubbery and other greenery within the corporate limits of the City: to recommend from time to time as necessary ordinances and other programs that will be beneficial to protect and maintain existing trees, shrubs and green areas and to encourage the development of private property owners of landscaped areas with trees and shrubs.
